<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - German May M3 due shortly.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - German May M3 due shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it will release M3 money supply data for the month of May shortly.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters on average expect M3 growth in May to have slowed to 6.2 percent versus the final quarter of 1996, down from 6.7 percent growth in April.</p>
<p>The range of forecasts was 6.0 to 6.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
